  "honesty": "Partial kit_cam map. Floor cells are a ground-plane paint out to 2.60 m, with one-cell holes filled. Kitchen-like yellow is a camera-ray bearing, not a waypoint and not arrival. A soft XY is frozen along that bearing the first time yellow is logged. Yellow >= 0.50 is not success. Frontiers are the 8-connected edge of that paint. Pose is the sim freejoint, not SLAM. The empty plant holds the claimed left prefix, then a 4 s forward gap and an 8 s left window when the dense rim is still left, then one vel(+0.056, -0.25) for 34 s. A 6 s gap swallows that left window. About 38 s of that right hold crosses up_z 0.90. vx=0 yaw is not used. Not go-anywhere.",
